<title>SWEDEN: Kinnevik sets dividend, sells unit.</title>
<headline>Kinnevik sets dividend, sells unit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish holding company Industriforvaltnings AB Kinnevik said on Tuesday it planned a cash dividend of 5 crowns per share for 1997, unchanged from 1996.</p>
<p>Kinnevik also said it would propose at a May 28 annual shareholders meeting that all shares in Modern Times Group (MTG) subsidiary should be sold.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
